        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by the attempt to modify a field in a constant structure (`chip_info`), which led to an access violation and a core dump. The `ch_param` array was being used as a variable, but since it was part of a const structure, any write operation to it resulted in undefined behavior and a page fault.

